      "notes": "Arch Linux based, macOS-like KDE Plasma 6 desktop on Wayland. Interactive Calamares installation requires an internet connection; no unattended path. User-supplied medium: every /iso/ URL now needs a signed link, so the plain URL in the vendor index answers 302 to a download-expired page and vmctl cannot fetch it. Download the ISO from https://pearos.xyz/download/ (the pay-what-you-want gate mints a free signed link) and save it as isos/pearOS-NiceC0re-2026.09-x86_64.iso. The size and SHA-256 pinned here come from the vendor release index https://pearos.xyz/assets/data/nicecore-versions.json; a fresh ISO is built monthly and older builds are retired, so refreshing the pin is maintenance."
    },
    "pearos-nicecore-unattended": {
